Subject: Select native texture animation playback and alias ownership
Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d

Select original GLTextureAnim playback and inventory traversal with checked
native frame extents, delta times and owned alias indices. Preserve one-frame
advance, discarded overshoot, pause, loop, ping-pong and hold behavior. Release
aliases before static frame textures; reject early frame release and refresh
of unregistered animations. Resolve cached bindings by owning ID/index.
The native port decodes fixed-width big-endian IFL records into pool-owned
native objects; original unchecked binary casts remain console-only. Skin,
vertex animation and the remaining full inventory loaders stay unselected.

